<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title>401 Authorization Required</title>
    <style>
        html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #fff; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Ubuntu, "Helvetica Neue", Arial,
            "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            color: #333;
        }
        .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 16vh auto 0; padding: 0 24px; }
        h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 20px; }
        p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #666; margin: 0 0 8px; }
        hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5; margin: 24px 0; }
        .sign { font-size: 13px; color: #999; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
    <h1>401 Authorization Required</h1>
    <p>The requested resource requires authentication.</p>
    <hr/>
    <p class="sign">nginx</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
